[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="game/player/Camera3D/HandbookContainer/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=63711651]
layout_mode = 2
text = "
Ammunition Types 

Cluster 
Standard issue high explosive cluster rounds 
Break into multiple smallre submunitions above ground
Maximum coverage ideal for above ground targets with 
weak or no armor plating




PIERCE
Standard issue armor penetrating round 
coloqueally known as the \"BUNKER BUSTER\"
The REInforced steel casing helps penetrate
Concrete and onther types of fortifications
Without detonating the payload
Ideal for use on large buildings and underground 
targets




Tactical Nuclear 
Tactical nuclear rounds carry a small yield uranium warhead
Meant for battlefield use 
Under no Circumstances are operators to load these shells 
Without authorization from at least 3 High officers



"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_3k0mj")

